    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 55,
      "text": "Build order: a second build, moved first, and an action"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 404,
      "text": "1. This body gets a build in: select it, Animate > Build In > Add an Effect > Appear.\n2. Open Build Order (bottom of the Animate panel) and drag the body's build above the title's, so the body appears first.\n3. Give the title an action: select it, Animate > Action > Add an Effect > Move, and drag its ghost a little to the right.\n4. Save. Nothing here passes or fails; what you build is the measurement."
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 236,
      "text": "The preexisting dissolve build on the title had some kind of defect, I cannot move it first in the Build Order, it remains third no matter what I do. The other animations I can move freely, though not after the dissolve in of the title."
    },
